extends layout

block content
  .container
    .jumbotron
      .container
        h1= title

        h2 What is this?

        p Ts3Bot is a stand alone nodejs application that observes clients connecting to your Teamspeak3 server. It provides a fully automated way for users to register with your Teamspeak3 server and grants/revokes permissions accordingly. This site is the bot's web-interface, its purpose is to provide a status report in realtime.

        h2 How to use it?
        
        p There is only one button on the landing page. If you click it the bot's status will be checked in the background and if it's not running as expected it's going to be rebooted.

  include footer